OL,3,GNEWSASunshine 'boost' for
OL,4,Aunder-pressure attractions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hot summer has given some tourist
OL,7,Fattractions a "much-needed boost" after
OL,8,Fa difficult few years, bosses have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FCornwall Visitor Alliance said sunny
OL,12,Fweather had "really helped" draw people
OL,13,Fin and spending improved, helping
OL,14,Frelieve pressure from rising running
OL,15,Fcosts.
OL,17,FAmong those reporting a positive season
OL,18,Fwas Crealy Theme and Resort Park in
OL,19,FDevon, one of the region's biggest
OL,20,Fattractions, which is considering how
OL,21,Fto adapt for the future after the
OL,22,Fhottest summer on record.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
