OL,3,GNEWSASunshine 'boost' for
OL,4,Aunder-pressure attractions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndoor attractions including the
OL,7,FNational Marine Aquarium in Plymouth
OL,8,Fsaid visitors had come to "escape from
OL,9,Fthe sun" but this was in contrast to
OL,10,FBodmin Jail which reported a "huge
OL,11,Fdecline" in numbers over summer.
